ai_context: 'Reach related views through the declared joins on this topic instead of re-deriving relationships.

  Use the modeled business fields maintenance_cost_to_revenue_impact_ratio, system_availability, system_unavailability rather than reconstructing their formulas.

  Domain definitions for this topic:

  - Mean Repair Cost: The total maintenance cost divided by the number of failure events (which can be inferred from the total operational time and MTBF). $C_{repair} = \frac{\text{Total Maintenance Cost}}{\text{Total Time} / MTBF}$.'
